{"info": {"author": null, "author_email": "Arnaud Miribel <arnaudmiribel@gmail.com>", "bugtrack_url": null, "classifiers": [], "description": "# Altex\n\nA simple wrapper on top of Altair to make charts in Streamlit with an express API. \n\nIf you're lazy and/or familiar with Altair, this is probably a good fit! Inspired by tvst/plost and plotly-express.\n\n## Installation\n\n```bash\npip install altex\n```\n\nOr with uv (recommended):\n```bash\nuv add altex\n```\n\n## Quick Start\n\n```python\nimport streamlit as st\nimport altex\nimport pandas as pd\n\n# Create sample data\ndata = pd.DataFrame({\n    'x': range(10),\n    'y': [i**2 for i in range(10)]\n})\n\n# Create and display charts in Streamlit\naltex.line_chart(data=data, x='x', y='y', title='My Chart')\naltex.bar_chart(data=data, x='x', y='y', color='x')\naltex.scatter_chart(data=data, x='x', y='y', opacity=0.7)\n```\n\n## \ud83c\udfa8 Demo App\n\nTry the interactive demo:\n\n```bash\n# Clone this repository\ngit clone https://github.com/arnaudmiribel/altex.git\ncd altex\nuv sync\nuv run streamlit run streamlit_app.py\n```\n\nThe demo showcases:\n- \ud83d\udcca Beautiful chart examples\n- \u2728 Sparklines for dashboards  \n- \ud83d\ude80 Quick start guide\n- \ud83d\udcdd Simple API examples\n\n## Chart Types\n\n- `line_chart()` - Line charts\n- `bar_chart()` - Bar charts  \n- `area_chart()` - Area charts\n- `scatter_chart()` - Scatter plots\n- `hist_chart()` - Histograms\n- `sparkline_chart()` - Sparkline charts\n- `sparkbar_chart()` - Spark bar charts\n- `sparkarea_chart()` - Spark area charts\n\n## Features\n\n- Simple, express-like API\n- Built on top of Altair\n- Automatic Streamlit integration when available\n- Sample data utilities\n- Support for rolling averages, custom styling, and more\n\n## License\n\nApache-2.0 ", "description_content_type": "text/markdown", "docs_url": null, "download_url": null, "downloads": {"last_day": -1, "last_month": -1, "last_week": -1}, "dynamic": null, "home_page": null, "keywords": "altair, charts, python, streamlit, visualization", "license": null, "license_expression": "Apache-2.0", "license_files": ["LICENSE"], "maintainer": null, "maintainer_email": null, "name": "altex", "package_url": "https://pypi.org/project/altex/", "platform": null, "project_url": "https://pypi.org/project/altex/", "project_urls": {"Bug Tracker": "https://github.com/arnaudmiribel/altex/issues", "Homepage": "https://github.com/arnaudmiribel/altex"}, "provides_extra": null, "release_url": "https://pypi.org/project/altex/0.2.0/", "requires_dist": ["altair>=4.0.0", "pandas>=1.0.0", "streamlit>=1.18.0"], "requires_python": "<3.14,>=3.9", "summary": "A simple wrapper on top of Altair to make charts with an express API", "version": "0.2.0", "yanked": false, "yanked_reason": null}, "releases": {"0.1.0": [{"comment_text": null, "core-metadata": {"sha256": "d974e0369b05d481da9940e5d0181edcfc55b25a63396f3587d67e9759758b4c"}, "digests": {"blake2b_256": "0cd0550be382fc2bbaed4c73bc74d3d1f8e2456c894ac3cfea0d916a00b5e42b", "md5": "800b629fdad511405ff27aff82537d57", "sha256": "a34ec1cb196b1a94b4ccd94dd020063f01c9c45f3df566a3a977d2e555ceb130"}, "downloads": -1, "filename": "altex-0.1.0-py3-none-any.whl", "has_sig": false, "md5_digest": "800b629fdad511405ff27aff82537d57", "packagetype": "bdist_wheel", "python_version": "py3", "requires_python": "<3.14,>=3.9", "size": 9589, "upload_time": "2025-06-30T16:39:35", "upload_time_iso_8601": "2025-06-30T16:39:35.662557Z", "url": "https://files.pythonhosted.org/packages/0c/d0/550be382fc2bbaed4c73bc74d3d1f8e2456c894ac3cfea0d916a00b5e42b/altex-0.1.0-py3-none-any.whl", "yanked": false, "yanked_reason": null}, {"comment_text": null, "core-metadata": false, "digests": {"blake2b_256": "8bb3b934105bcbd364a729444b3a631f11ec4f357e46897f83209668f1265016", "md5": "f9f87007a07edd2df69f3dae3b8aeab2", "sha256": "db530f4775bb1d6c5e6f7571657edc730eab5fc4bab9e39587f1d36a6b3e97f1"}, "downloads": -1, "filename": "altex-0.1.0.tar.gz", "has_sig": fals